  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Uncle Jr**: back after 66 archived shows (453 days) [3]\n- **Soul Power**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **banter - inviting Sam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Reunion**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2001-08-10.mk4.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 7 songs; 91 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sam Kinninger joined the band on alto sax [1]\n- The lower lodge was jammed full by the time the reviewer arrived a few minutes late, with no standing room inside [2]\n- The reviewer found a rear entrance, apparently used by the band, and got extremely close to the stage with a small group [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2001-08-10.mk4.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [1]. Also: Recorded on-stage with Schoeps mk4 microphones in ORTF, run through a Lunatec 316 preamp into a DAT recorder at 44.1kHz; Eric McRoberts recorded and transferred it; the original DAT became SHN on 08/18/2001, then FLAC on 11/5/2014 [1]",
